            <title>[LU-6890] recovery-mds-scale test_failover_mds: get_param Found no match</title>
                <link>https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-6890</link>
                <project id="10000" key="LU">Lustre</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;This issue was created by maloo for sarah_lw &amp;lt;wei3.liu@intel.com&amp;gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;This issue relates to the following test suite run: &lt;a href="https://testing.hpdd.intel.com/test_sets/7f9b6fea-2623-11e5-92e6-5254006e85c2" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener"&gt;https://testing.hpdd.intel.com/test_sets/7f9b6fea-2623-11e5-92e6-5254006e85c2&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The sub-test test_failover_mds failed with the following error:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="preformatted panel" style="border-width: 1px;"&gt;&lt;div class="preformattedContent panelContent"&gt;
&lt;pre&gt;test_failover_mds returned 7
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;


&lt;p&gt;It looks like the same issue as &lt;a href="https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-2415" title="recovery-mds-scale test_failover_mds: lustre:MDT0000/recovery_status found no match" class="issue-link" data-issue-key="LU-2415"&gt;&lt;del&gt;LU-2415&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt; but &lt;a href="https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-2415" title="recovery-mds-scale test_failover_mds: lustre:MDT0000/recovery_status found no match" class="issue-link" data-issue-key="LU-2415"&gt;&lt;del&gt;LU-2415&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt; has been fixed for a while.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="preformatted panel" style="border-width: 1px;"&gt;&lt;div class="preformattedContent panelContent"&gt;
&lt;pre&gt;CMD: onyx-34vm1 lctl get_param -n at_max
affected facets: mds1
CMD: onyx-34vm7 PATH=/usr/lib64/lustre/tests:/usr/lib/lustre/tests:/usr/lib64/lustre/tests:/opt/iozone/bin:/opt/iozone/bin:/usr/lib64/mpi/gcc/openmpi/bin:/usr/lib64/lustre/tests/mpi:/usr/lib64/lustre/tests/racer:/usr/lib64/lustre/../lustre-iokit/sgpdd-survey:/usr/lib64/lustre/tests:/usr/lib64/lustre/utils/gss:/usr/lib64/lustre/utils:/usr/bin:/bin:/usr/sbin:/sbin::/sbin:/bin:/usr/sbin: NAME=autotest_config sh rpc.sh _wait_recovery_complete *.lustre:MDT0000.recovery_status 1475 
onyx-34vm7: error: get_param: */lustre:MDT0000/recovery_status: Found no match
mds1 recovery is not completed!
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</description>
                <environment>server: lustre-master build # 3093 RHEL7.1&lt;br/&gt;
client: SLES11 SP3</environment>
